      [ narr:op "added" ; narr:text """A twelfth rendering of the weekly ruling closes the span: [the roll-up rule restated once more](narr:Expr_20261007_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_hed495c46f84c_2), with [the replacement question answered again](narr:Expr_20261007_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_hed495c46f84c_4) and [the daily digest rejected yet again](narr:Expr_20261007_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_hed495c46f84c_5).""" ]
